    top: 80
    left: 30
    width: 290
    height: 90
    class: policy
  }
  dual: Exact Rust + Lean evaluation\nSame bytes / full result verified {
    top: 270
    left: 30
    width: 290
    height: 90
    class: runtime
  }
  post: Recheck owner / cut / Decision\nReject drift and erroring policy IDs {
    top: 460
    left: 30
    width: 290
    height: 90
